{"availability":"available","full":"Felix-au/QuantX-Stock-Analysis-and-Forecast","name":"QuantX-Stock-Analysis-and-Forecast","description":"An advanced stock analysis and forecasting platform.  QuantX provides real-time financial metrics, key technical indicators (SMA, EMA, MACD, RSI),  and sentiment-analyzed market news. It features a prediction engine  that runs and contrasts 8 models, ranging from classical time-series to machine learning.","category":"Finance","language":"Python","stars":19,"forks":2,"created":"2024-10-31T00:13:23Z","updated":"2026-07-21T12:40:31Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://quantx.streamlit.app","topics":["finance","machine-learning","plotly","prophet","python","quant-finance","stock-analysis","stock-forecasting","streamlit","technical-indicators","xgboost","yfinance"],"demo":"https://quantx.streamlit.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:07.744Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:07.744Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:07.744Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:47:02.691Z","stars":19,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:23:07.744Z","stars":19,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An elegant, high-fidelity AI-powered dashboard to analyze stock trends, compute technical indicators, and forecast stock prices using optimized Machine Learning.","Real-time market analytics, automated sentiment scoring, and multi-model financial forecasting driven by Python and Streamlit.","QuantX is an open-source financial analytics and machine learning forecasting tool. Built with modern modular Python and managed via the Rust-based uv package manager, QuantX provides real-time market overviews for global indices and individual stocks (including Indian NSE stocks with .NS suffixes)."],"features":["Feature Construction: Constructs temporal feature matrices containing day indexes, day of the week, and month numbers.","Standardization: Features are scaled